WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.160
Robots are no longer the stuff of science fiction.
机器人不再只是科幻小说里的东西了。

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:17.640
As the technology matures, they will soon become a familiar part of campus life, taking over routine tasks and leaving students and teachers more time for what really matters.
随着技术日趋成熟，它们很快就会成为校园生活中司空见惯的一部分，承担日常事务，让学生和老师有更多时间去做真正重要的事情。

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:22.990
In the near future, robots are likely to be useful in at least three areas.
在不久的将来，机器人很可能至少在三个方面派上用场。

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:31.040
First, they could deliver packages and meals around campus, so students would no longer have to wait in line at pickup points.
第一，它们可以在校园里递送包裹和饭菜，这样学生就不必再在取件点排队等候了。

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:38.680
Second, robot assistants in the library could help readers locate books and put returned ones back on the right shelves.
第二，图书馆里的机器人助手可以帮助读者找到图书，并把归还的书放回正确的书架上。

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:49.930
Third, in laboratories, robots could carry out dangerous or repetitive procedures with great precision, reducing risks and freeing students to focus on creative thinking.
第三，在实验室里，机器人能够非常精确地完成危险或重复性的操作，从而降低风险，让学生腾出精力专注于创造性思考。

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:53.950
Still, robots should serve people rather than replace them.
不过，机器人应当为人服务，而不是取代人。

00:00:54.750 --> 00:01:05.300
The university needs clear rules to protect students’ privacy, and students should remember that no machine can take the place of face-to-face communication with teachers and classmates.
学校需要制定明确的规则来保护学生的隐私，学生也应该记住，任何机器都无法取代与老师和同学面对面的交流。

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.800
If used wisely, robots will make our campus safer, smarter and more efficient for everyone.
只要使用得当，机器人就会让我们的校园对每个人来说都更安全、更智能、更高效。
